GoldenEye Check runs third-party programs as separate processes. They are not part
of GoldenEye Check, are not modified, and are downloaded by "gecheck install" from
their official releases with SHA-256 verification:

- gitleaks, https://github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks, MIT License
- osv-scanner, https://github.com/google/osv-scanner, Apache License 2.0
- opengrep, https://github.com/opengrep/opengrep, GNU LGPL 2.1

The rules in gecheck/rules are written by GoldenEye and distributed under the license
of this repository. Rules from the Semgrep registry are not used.
